Validate unique route keys, valid parent references, no circular menu hierarchy,
no orphan pages, and no duplicate/conflicting navigation identifiers.
Do not permit arbitrary unsafe JavaScript, HTML, SQL, or executable code in
configuration fields.

Step 4 — Page and feature builder
For each page, allow administrators to choose approved reusable page templates
and components, where available, such as:
