- Lookup source and reference integrity
- Searchable, filterable, sortable, and exportable properties
- Field-level permissions and sensitive-data classification
- Help text, localization label, and error messages
- Conditional field behavior based on supported declarative rules
- Change history and configuration version

Do not allow a UI configuration to silently change an existing production
database column or destructive schema. Distinguish metadata-backed custom fields
from fields requiring a database migration. Schema changes must be reviewed,
