- Edit
- Submit
- Approve/reject
- Delete/cancel, only if business rules permit
- Import/export
- Configure module
- Manage permissions
- Activate/deactivate
- View audit logs
- Administer integrations

Apply least privilege and deny by default. Only designated platform
administrators may register, publish, or change modules. Module owners may
manage permitted module settings but must not grant themselves higher privileges.
Permission changes must be audited. Enforce access on the server/API as well as
in the user interface.

Step 8 — Integrations and services
Allow selection and configuration of approved integration types, such as:
- SAP Business One HANA through the authorized Service Layer or another
